     "text": "**Initiating TDD Implementation**\n\nI'm starting on the first vertical slice as specified, using Test-Driven Development. I'll be working through the `specs/M1-grade.md` document, focusing on one test at a time, test first, code second, making sure to show my work!\n\n\n",
